    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d612">

                <pb facs="0742" n="640" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg640"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">693.003/447: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Reinsch</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1917-10-02T14:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 2,
                                1917, 2 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received
                            October 2, 9.60 a.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your instructions September 20, 4 p.m.<anchor n="63" xml:id="d612-f1"/> are
                    understood to the effect that if the Chinese Government withholds the payment of
                    the Boxer indemnity during the period stated no objection will be made by the
                    American Government on the condition specified.</p>
                <p>The Chinese Government has proposed the assembling of an international commission
                    at Shanghai for the purpose of revising the specific tariff to yield 5 per cent
                    effective as provided by the treaties. I beg to suggest that a commission be
                    designated and that the Commercial Attaché possesses the necessary knowledge of
                    the situation.</p>
                <p>Also I beg to query whether or not, as the recomputation of the 5 per cent
                    effective is in essence an administrative act, the consent of the Senate to the
                    determinations of the commission will be required.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
